                        skos:definition "Students are considered to have withdrawn if they transfer to a new post-secondary institution and there is a gap of more than two weeks between the last date of attendance at the first post-secondary institution and the first date of attendance at the second post-secondary institution." ;
                        prov:wasDerivedFrom data:CAN_UNIT_00498 .


