                                                   cco:Condition ;
                                          rdfs:label "Eligibility Criteria" ;
                                          prov:wasDerivedFrom data:CAN_UNIT_00380 ;
                                          cco:hasConditionExpression "A letter from a responsible third party testifying as to the truthfulness of the student’s explanation and providing an independent assessment of the situation. The ‘third party’ could be any of the following: counselor, psychologist, religious advisor, doctor, teacher, and/or mature relative outside the immediate family or family friend (the status of the third party and their relationship to the student must be identified in the letter)." .


